<title>USA: Top Source gets purchase order from Chrysler.</title>
<headline>Top Source gets purchase order from Chrysler.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top Source Technologies Inc said Friday that Chrysler Corp has ordered an on-site oil analyzer produced by Top Source.</p>
<p>The value of the order was not disclosed.</p>
<p>The device detects early warning signs of engine, transmission and gear case problems in cars, Top Source said.</p>
